From c0a58d4bb6568648c0c6b4ee71747b338f7bcf0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (Phase 1 assistant)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:08:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 1: Liquid Island visual foundation

Replace the eye-based EyeLand UI with a Dynamic Island-inspired design system.
- three states (compact / mini / full) with CSS-driven morphing and reduced-motion support
- reusable activity area (volume, brightness, media, timer, notices) over a dashboard
  (clock, weather via existing backend, quick actions, plugin navigation, timer, clipboard, tasks, settings)
- restyle plugin hub, new app/tray icons, rename user-visible strings
- keep userData folder, IPC, plugins, settings and shortcuts unchanged
- fix pre-existing race where hub:open sent during hub startup was lost
- add tools/ui-harness and docs/PHASE1_REPORT.md

Not tested on Windows; see docs/PHASE1_REPORT.md.
